# L §2.1: "A four-digit literal is a year where a period is expected and an integer in an integer index; where both
# readings fit, it is refused (LOAD-AMBIG, D-14)."  2026 - 1 reads as year − int and as int − int.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

ask q1: 2026 - 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-AMBIG ...
